{"publicId":"82d1b4c4-39e7-45db-85a8-15cf1f9313cb","title":"耶鲁医学院开发单细胞DNA折叠与表观遗传标记映射新方法Epi-PHR","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T20:40:01.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T20:40:01.000Z","digest":"耶鲁医学院开发的新方法Epi-PHR首次同时检测单细胞DNA折叠和表观遗传标记，高分辨率分析结果发表于《Nature Methods》。\n该方法结合单细胞测序与荧光显微镜技术，解决了传统方法在空间分辨率（<1μm）和样本量（需数万细胞）上的局限，已在小鼠胚胎干细胞和人类癌细胞系中验证，可识别DNA超螺旋、甲基化等结构特征。\n目前该方法仅公布在小鼠和人类癌细胞系的数据，未涉及人类健康细胞样本，临床转化需进一步研究。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T21:02:39.350Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"耶鲁医学院在 Nature Methods 发表单细胞 DNA folding 与表观遗传标记映射新方法","latestReport":{"id":"a95j5jj6qababqa29stit7eul"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fm_80pSrZDDM","title":"新方法揭示单个细胞中的DNA折叠和表观遗传标记","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T20:40:01.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"a95j5jj6qababqa29stit7eul","title":"耶鲁医学院在 Nature Methods 发表单细胞 DNA folding 与表观遗传标记映射新方法","summary":"耶鲁医学院研究团队在《Nature Methods》发表单细胞 DNA folding 与表观遗传标记映射新方法（Epi-PHR），首次实现同时检测两者的高分辨率分析。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T20:40:01.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"a95j5jj6qababqa29stit7eul","title":"耶鲁医学院在 Nature Methods 发表单细胞 DNA folding 与表观遗传标记映射新方法","summary":"耶鲁医学院研究团队在《Nature Methods》发表单细胞 DNA folding 与表观遗传标记映射新方法（Epi-PHR），首次实现同时检测两者的高分辨率分析。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T20:40:01.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T21:00:00.000Z","heat":9.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T22:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T23:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T01:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T02:00:00.000Z","heat":8.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T03:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"ho